            "background_color": "#FFFFFF",
            "text_color": "#2B2B2B",
            "review_1_quote": "You won't find a shopping experience like this at a department store or online. What a warm and welcoming environment and a JUDGMENT FREE ZONE. I walked in to Be-YOU-Tiful for the first time with my hair all crazy and in my lazy clothes not knowing what to expect and I found SO many cute things, including this colorful pink top that matched perfectly with some pants I had been waiting to wear! I will definitely be back- I can't wait to see what else comes in!",
            "review_1_author": "Google Reviewer",
            "review_2_quote": "What a gem in downtown Punta Gorda! The inventory is diverse from cute skorts to long dresses and the customer service is unmatched. GO soon....you won't be sorry.",
